{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvackur5YpkqQVxoC7ua","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Don't remove it yet. The data can't support that decision, but it can't justify a full rollout either.**\n\n**Why 4% is weak evidence**\n- **The number is probably an undercount.** Five of 14 days (36%) went unlogged. Anyone who first tried the feature on those days is missing, so 4% is closer to a floor than a measurement.\n- **There's no benchmark.** Is 4% low for a feature like this? Without a target or a comparison to similar launches, \"low\" is just a feeling.\n- **\"Tried\" is the wrong measure.** Adoption in the first two weeks says little about value. Repeat use, retention of users who tried it, and whether scheduled events actually stick matter more.\n- **Exposure is unknown.** If most users never saw the entry point, low trial reflects discoverability, not demand.\n\n**Why waiting is cheap**\nKeeping the feature at 10% costs little. Removing it is a visible, hard-to-reverse decision made on corrupted data.\n\n**What I'd do**\n1. Fix the pipeline and confirm it's logging correctly.\n2. Try to backfill the gap from other sources, such as server logs or database records of auto-scheduled events.\n3. Agree on success criteria *now*, before seeing more data. For example: a trial rate of X%, Y% repeat use among triers, and a retention comparison against non-users.\n4. Run two more weeks of clean data. Add exposure tracking (how many users saw the feature) if it's missing.\n5. Look at the users who did try it. Do they come back? A few short interviews would help.\n\nIf clean data still shows low trial, low repeat use, and no downstream benefit, removal is defensible. If trial is low but repeat use is high, the problem is discoverability, and the fix is better placement, not removal."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3822,"cache_read_input_tokens":4609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3822},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64bb04bb-94ea-4299-b499-fd957672b80d","uuid":"33c2292a-561c-489b-b997-8c055518abe3","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:07:54.263Z","request_id":"req_011CfvackgD4dZpfBXptzMUH"}
